From: MaSi-OS <masies@local>
Subject: [PATCH] ath12k: WCN7850 keep ASPM off + log AMSS path (7.0.14 FW)

7.2.8 ath12k_wifi7 binds WCN7850, MHI "Power on setup success", then never
reaches AMSS / wlan. Same 7.0.14 amss.bin+board-2.bin works on 7.0.14.

ath12k only clears ASPM on the endpoint. The PCIe root port can still enter
L1 and the AMSS switch hangs. Do not restore ASPM on WCN7850. Log the AMSS
path at info so a failed boot shows API1 amss.bin vs firmware-2.bin.

Signed-off-by: MaSi-OS <masies@local>

diff -u -N -r a/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath12k/mhi.c b/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath12k/mhi.c
--- a/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath12k/mhi.c	2026-09-29 01:52:05.094920553 +0200
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath12k/mhi.c	2026-09-29 01:52:05.187969579 +0200
@@ -242,6 +242,12 @@
 		}
 	}
 
+	if (mhi_ctrl->fw_image)
+		ath12k_info(ab, "mhi AMSS %s\n", mhi_ctrl->fw_image);
+	else
+		ath12k_info(ab, "mhi AMSS from firmware-N.bin (%zu bytes)\n",
+			    mhi_ctrl->fw_sz);
+
 	ret = ath12k_mhi_get_msi(ab_pci);
 	if (ret) {
 		ath12k_err(ab, "failed to get msi for mhi\n");
diff -u -N -r a/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath12k/pci.c b/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath12k/pci.c
--- a/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath12k/pci.c	2026-09-29 01:52:05.097880460 +0200
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath12k/pci.c	2026-09-29 01:52:05.188179472 +0200
@@ -1140,7 +1140,8 @@
 
 	set_bit(ATH12K_PCI_FLAG_INIT_DONE, &ab_pci->flags);
 
-	if (test_bit(ATH12K_PCI_FLAG_MULTI_MSI_VECTORS, &ab_pci->flags))
+	if (test_bit(ATH12K_PCI_FLAG_MULTI_MSI_VECTORS, &ab_pci->flags) &&
+	    ab->hw_params->supports_aspm)
 		ath12k_pci_aspm_restore(ab_pci);
 	else
 		ath12k_info(ab, "leaving PCI ASPM disabled to avoid MHI M2 problems\n");
diff -u -N -r a/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath12k/wifi7/hw.c b/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath12k/wifi7/hw.c
--- a/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath12k/wifi7/hw.c	2026-09-29 01:52:05.100236365 +0200
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath12k/wifi7/hw.c	2026-09-29 01:52:05.188310200 +0200
@@ -521,7 +521,7 @@
 
 		.iova_mask = ATH12K_PCIE_MAX_PAYLOAD_SIZE - 1,
 
-		.supports_aspm = true,
+		.supports_aspm = false,
 
 		.ce_ie_addr = NULL,
 		.ce_remap = NULL,
